.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH QUIPU-PROPOSE-ACCEPT 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-propose\-accept \- Accept a pending proposal; refused when its plan is over the risk threshold unless \-\-accept\-risk \-\-reason
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu propose accept\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-decided\-by\fR] [\fB\-\-note\fR] [\fB\-\-reason\fR] [\fB\-\-risk\-threshold\fR] [\fB\-\-accept\-risk\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIid\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Accept a pending proposal; refused when its plan is over the risk threshold unless \-\-accept\-risk \-\-reason
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-decided\-by\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Identity recording the alignment decision
.TP
\fB\-\-note\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Explanatory note recorded with the operation
.TP
\fB\-\-reason\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-risk\-threshold\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-accept\-risk\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIid\fR>

